{"data": [{"author_id": "1745106082790318080", "created_at": "2026-10-26T18:48:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114791350461710835"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/OkNUnaCZCm", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2114791350461710835/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114791347693465601", "start": 0, "url": "https://t.co/OkNUnaCZCm"}]}, "id": "2114791350461710835", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 61, "impression_count": 31397, "like_count": 978, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 18, "retweet_count": 38}, "text": "https://t.co/OkNUnaCZCm", "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2114791350461710835"}, {"author_id": "4398626122", "created_at": "2026-10-26T18:06:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114780711664398349"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/8JTN1yonmV", "end": 280, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2114780711664398349/video/1", "media_key": "13_2114778494395678720", "start": 257, "url": "https://t.co/8JTN1yonmV"}]}, "id": "2114780711664398349", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2321, "impression_count": 1303312, "like_count": 15396, "quote_count": 1050, "reply_count": 863, "retweet_count": 1123}, "text": "GPT-6.1 Terra: delivering fast and capable computer use at a lower price.\n\nGPT-6.1 Terra understands what’s on screen, takes action across apps, writes naturally, and is a more capable model for your whole workday with the efficiency to take on more of it. https://t.co/8JTN1yonmV", "url": "https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2114780711664398349"}, {"author_id": "1745106082790318080", "created_at": "2026-10-26T18:01:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114779348838338719"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/G9liiKmGvh", "end": 190, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2114779348838338719/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114779345944293376", "start": 167, "url": "https://t.co/G9liiKmGvh"}]}, "id": "2114779348838338719", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 17, "impression_count": 13375, "like_count": 41, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Congrats to the SGLang and RadixArk team for their amazing work on MegaKernel + PD, improving both high concurrency throughput and low-latency serving as well! (1/2)🧵 https://t.co/G9liiKmGvh", "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2114779348838338719"}, {"author_id": "2939913921", "created_at": "2026-10-26T17:50:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114776660344246735"], "id": "2114776660344246735", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 48, "impression_count": 15783, "like_count": 421, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 36, "retweet_count": 28}, "text": "This weird qwen behavior is going to go viral because no one has read traces from mid-tier open models and realized they're almost all super janky.", "url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2114776660344246735"}, {"author_id": "2939913921", "created_at": "2026-10-26T17:27:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114770812058186077"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/cohere/status/…", "end": 156, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/cohere/status/2114752002370544004", "start": 133, "url": "https://t.co/RJ7ntEokIi"}]}, "id": "2114770812058186077", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 56, "impression_count": 16164, "like_count": 403, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 26, "retweet_count": 21}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114752002370544004", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Simplest explanation is just a narrow RL training reliant on their internal infra (which isn't good design for an open weight model) https://t.co/RJ7ntEokIi", "url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2114770812058186077"}, {"author_id": "2939913921", "created_at": "2026-10-26T16:57:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114763312843964640"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/6KbSRMT14f", "end": 33, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2114763312843964640/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114763307466792960