eliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems.", "display_url": "anthropic.com/news/s1-sec", "end": 127, "expanded_url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/s1-sec", "images": [{"height": 1260, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114705043555315712/CdumPkue?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 2400}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114705043555315712/CdumPkue?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 104, "status": 200, "title": "Anthropic files S-1 with the SEC for proposed initial public offering", "unwound_url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/s1-sec", "url": "https://t.co/zuRMrxXzNx"}]}, "id": "2114705042817110293", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2307, "impression_count": 4187155, "like_count": 14539, "quote_count": 1829, "reply_count": 1009, "retweet_count": 1788}, "text": "Anthropic has filed an S-1 registration statement with the SEC related to its proposed IPO.\n\nRead more: https://t.co/zuRMrxXzNx\n\nLegal disclaimer: A registration statement relating to these securities has been filed with the SEC but has not yet become effective. These securities", "url": "https://x.com/AnthropicAI/status/2114705042817110293"}, {"author_id": "2939913921", "created_at": "2026-10-26T12:33:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114696948301152573"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/bhKSKeIICv", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2114696948301152573/video/1", "media_key": "13_2114694763366490112", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/bhKSKeIICv"}]}, "id": "2114696948301152573", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 612, "impression_count": 28487, "like_count": 656, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 58, "retweet_count": 84}, "text": "My first open model lecture, covering all the many pieces that build the ecosystem, and the open questions/debates determining where it goes next.\n\nHow does distillation fit in?\nHow do we manage risks?\nHow do we see access to models changing in the future?\n\nI'm excited to revisit https://t.co/bhKSKeIICv", "url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2114696948301152573"}, {"author_id": "1745106082790318080", "created_at": "2026-10-25T23:16:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114496296455184834"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 32, "id": "1774187564276289536", "start": 19, "username": "vllm_project"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Y26LxXUn28", "end": 293, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2114496296455184834/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114496293510819840", "start": 270, "url": "https://t.co/Y26LxXUn28"}]}, "id": "2114496296455184834", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 99, "impression_count": 47747, "like_count": 399, "quote_count": 13, "reply_count": 58, "retweet_count": 22}, "text": "PROFIT ALERT🚨: AMD @vllm_project can generate up to $3/hr/chip in pure profit serving the open-source Kimi K3 model, even after accounting for the rapid increase in chip rental prices post-Claude Code.\n\nKimi K3 2.8T is a great model for AMD, as it has over 2.8 trillion https://t.co/Y26LxXUn28", "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2114496296455184834"}, {"author_id": "2939913921", "created_at": "2026-10-25T12:46:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114337845548584983"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Y1KfrdKSfa", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2114337845548584983/video/1", "media_key": "13_2114324724717125632", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/Y1KfrdKSfa"}]}, "id": "2114337845548584983", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 83, "impression_count": 17371, "like_count": 188, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 29, "retweet_count": 14}, "text": "Interconnects Podcast #20: We got together to debate hard questions and messy realities after a crazy, somewhat intimidating, week in the AI world:\n- Why did Kimi K3.1 Pro have a mixed reaction with such incredible benchmarks? Will it be adopted?\n- Were we wrong about the risks https://t.co/Y1KfrdKSfa", "url": "https://x.c